(4507946, 649387, 811, '<td valign="top">I almost did this one!!  I like the simple color theme.  Focus on the front die could be a bit sharper.  Since it is in front, and since it is red, it just screams for the viewer''s attention.  Since it is just a touch soft, it makes the entire picture feel soft.  <br/> <br/>I''ve also got some of these clear die and they are hard to focus on.  I''m thinking perhaps the camera is trying to focus "through" them.  I finally had to sit up a regular die, focus, switch it to manual, then shoot with the clear one.</td>', 'I almost did this one!!  I like the simple color theme.  Focus on the front die could be a bit sharper.  Since it is in front, and since it is red, it just screams for the viewer''s attention.  Since it is just a touch soft, it makes the entire picture feel soft.   I''ve also got some of these clear die and they are hard to focus on.  I''m thinking perhaps the camera is trying to focus "through" them.  I finally had to sit up a regular die, focus, switch it to manual, then shoot with the clear one.', '2008-02-22 16:43:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(4507948, 648784, 57358, '<td valign="top">not sure about the grainy-ness or the type of border, but definitely an improvement over the original.  I like your title and your composition - it was probably hard to get your kitty riled up like in the other photo, lol</td>', 'not sure about the grainy-ness or the type of border, but definitely an improvement over the original.  I like your title and your composition - it was probably hard to get your kitty riled up like in the other photo, lol', '2008-02-22 16:45:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(4507952, 649159, 811, '<td valign="top">Very nice, rich colors.  Maybe less black border and more black from the trees and land.  The thickness of the border is pulling my attention away from a rather nice shot.</td>', 'Very nice, rich colors.  Maybe less black border and more black from the trees and land.  The thickness of the border is pulling my attention away from a rather nice shot.', '2008-02-22 16:49:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(4507955, 649747, 57358, '<td valign="top">a deja vu of a deja vu, interesting : )  Did you look up the first original?  anyway, this is a definite improvement over the brown ribbon one.  it''s hard to photograph jewelry (or other shiny things) though.  It''s hard to control the glare and to hide every little scratch or fingerprint.  I would have liked if your focus on the dial were a little sharper though I give you props for attempting this shot - I couldn''t pull it off</td>', 'a deja vu of a deja vu, interesting : )  Did you look up the first original?  anyway, this is a definite improvement over the brown ribbon one.  it''s hard to photograph jewelry (or other shiny things) though.  It''s hard to control the glare and to hide every little scratch or fingerprint.  I would have liked if your focus on the dial were a little sharper though I give you props for attempting this shot - I couldn''t pull it off', '2008-02-22 16:50:02.000000', NULL, 1),
