(4508202, 648955, 86379, '<td valign="top">beautiful eyes! nice image.</td>', 'beautiful eyes! nice image.', '2008-02-22 18:29:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(4508204, 649737, 86379, '<td valign="top">the orange slices look amazing but i''m not sure about the white milky stuff on the bottom.</td>', 'the orange slices look amazing but i''m not sure about the white milky stuff on the bottom.', '2008-02-22 18:31:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(4508205, 647949, 86379, '<td valign="top">nice capture. incredible eyes.</td>', 'nice capture. incredible eyes.', '2008-02-22 18:31:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(4508206, 647930, 86379, '<td valign="top">i might have cloned out the black specs (pieces of seeds?) but overall nice image.</td>', 'i might have cloned out the black specs (pieces of seeds?) but overall nice image.', '2008-02-22 18:33:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(4508208, 649600, 86379, '<td valign="top">i like the border and the colors in this. and so sharp you can see the apple''s reflection in the kitty''s eyes. well done!</td>', 'i like the border and the colors in this. and so sharp you can see the apple''s reflection in the kitty''s eyes. well done!', '2008-02-22 18:35:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(4508211, 649784, 86379, '<td valign="top">Ahhhhhhhhh you really pissed him off to get this, huh? nice ''action'' shot :)</td>', 'Ahhhhhhhhh you really pissed him off to get this, huh? nice ''action'' shot :)', '2008-02-22 18:36:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(4508220, 648610, 86379, '<td valign="top">i haven''t seen the original ''brown'', but this is very creative. i like the worn doors and the bricks.</td>', 'i haven''t seen the original ''brown'', but this is very creative. i like the worn doors and the bricks.', '2008-02-22 18:44:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(4508221, 649475, 86379, '<td valign="top">the piano keys in the foreground seem to blend together a little. but overall, very nice.</td>', 'the piano keys in the foreground seem to blend together a little. but overall, very nice.', '2008-02-22 18:44:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(4508223, 648325, 86379, '<td valign="top">the lighting appears to be perfect in this shot. the colors work very well together. well done!</td>', 'the lighting appears to be perfect in this shot. the colors work very well together. well done!', '2008-02-22 18:46:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(4508472, 647573, 57358, '<td valign="top">not sure if you''re referring to this photo: <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=507" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/0-999/8/120/507.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/0-999/8/120/507.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/0-999/8/120/507.jpg"/></a> but I''m going to assume yes.<br/> <br/>as for this photo, I think that the glare (I''m not sure what it is) in the bottom left destracts from the photo - it''s advanced editing - you could clone it out.  I think you could have gotten a cleaner shot of the moon too, maybe by using a higher aperture, or faster shutter speed - or a tripod if you didn''t use one.  I like your composition and I would like to see this shot done again - it has real potential.</td>', 'not sure if you''re referring to this photo:  but I''m going to assume yes. as for this photo, I think that the glare (I''m not sure what it is) in the bottom left destracts from the photo - it''s advanced editing - you could clone it out.  I think you could have gotten a cleaner shot of the moon too, maybe by using a higher aperture, or faster shutter speed - or a tripod if you didn''t use one.  I like your composition and I would like to see this shot done again - it has real potential.', '2008-02-22 20:28:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(4508475, 649600, 88136, '<td valign="top">i love the refelction of the apple in the cats eyes</td>', 'i love the refelction of the apple in the cats eyes', '2008-02-22 20:32:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(4508476, 649645, 88136, '<td valign="top">lol i dig this photo. hilarious-8</td>', 'lol i dig this photo. hilarious-8', '2008-02-22 20:34:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(4508478, 647457, 57358, '<td valign="top">lol, what a great photo to reproduce.  I would have liked to see everything left out of the photo except the butter and possibly the plate it''s on.  your focus also looks like it''s on the can and bottle more than the butter.  these are all detracting factors.  I would be interested to see a reshoot of this with just the butter up close and filling almost the entire frame.</td>', 'lol, what a great photo to reproduce.  I would have liked to see everything left out of the photo except the butter and possibly the plate it''s on.  your focus also looks like it''s on the can and bottle more than the butter.  these are all detracting factors.  I would be interested to see a reshoot of this with just the butter up close and filling almost the entire frame.', '2008-02-22 20:35:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(4508507, 647681, 36102, '<td valign="top">wow who knew toliet paper could look so pretty</td>', 'wow who knew toliet paper could look so pretty', '2008-02-22 21:09:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(4508514, 647708, 36102, '<td valign="top">very interesting handles, nice job on the glare and reflection (lack of)</td>', 'very interesting handles, nice job on the glare and reflection (lack of)', '2008-02-22 21:14:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(4508516, 647930, 36102, '<td valign="top">At first I thought this was a lemon.  Good macro though</td>', 'At first I thought this was a lemon.  Good macro though', '2008-02-22 21:15:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(4508572, 648622, 36102, '<td valign="top">Very nice, so crisp and clear.  I like this one.</td>', 'Very nice, so crisp and clear.  I like this one.', '2008-02-22 21:32:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(4508593, 649485, 11769, '<td valign="top">:)</td>', ':)', '2008-02-22 21:45:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(4508623, 647503, 26878, '<td valign="top">well you added a border so Ill give you points there,  hopefully this wont get last place again.   nice choice for the brown challenge though, lol.</td>', 'well you added a border so Ill give you points there,  hopefully this wont get last place again.   nice choice for the brown challenge though, lol.', '2008-02-22 22:08:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(4508671, 649732, 57358, '<td valign="top">great remake - very clean, nice composition, no harsh reflections, soft shadows.  the only thing that could make this photo better would be more interesting silverware - but that''s hard to do : )</td>', 'great remake - very clean, nice composition, no harsh reflections, soft shadows.  the only thing that could make this photo better would be more interesting silverware - but that''s hard to do : )', '2008-02-22 22:38:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(4508681, 647403, 57358, '<td valign="top">hmm...  I think you picked a very hard photo to redo - the subject matter is tough to make look good.  however, I think it could be better if it were more in focus and possibly from a different angle.  I''m also not too keen on the border.</td>', 'hmm...  I think you picked a very hard photo to redo - the subject matter is tough to make look good.  however, I think it could be better if it were more in focus and possibly from a different angle.  I''m also not too keen on the border.', '2008-02-22 22:42:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(4508689, 649737, 57358, '<td valign="top">your colors look great and you used the same composition as the original.  not so sure I like the texture of the cutting board, especially where it is highlighted at the bottom by your light.  this is a hard shot to do, but maybe a deeper dof would help on the fruit and not so much water pooled around the bottom.  I would love to see a reshoot - this is very close</td>', 'your colors look great and you used the same composition as the original.  not so sure I like the texture of the cutting board, especially where it is highlighted at the bottom by your light.  this is a hard shot to do, but maybe a deeper dof would help on the fruit and not so much water pooled around the bottom.  I would love to see a reshoot - this is very close', '2008-02-22 22:45:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(4508694, 649572, 57358, '<td valign="top">your color seems to be a little on the dark side, but good saturation.  this would have been better with a deeper dof on the oranges to bring out more texture and sharpness.  maybe also use a smooth surface instead of the cutting board.  I like the composition and balance</td>', 'your color seems to be a little on the dark side, but good saturation.  this would have been better with a deeper dof on the oranges to bring out more texture and sharpness.  maybe also use a smooth surface instead of the cutting board.  I like the composition and balance', '2008-02-22 22:47:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(4508704, 647495, 57358, '<td valign="top">great take on the original.  I love the pattern that the red, yellow and white made.  seems to be in pretty good focus and the composition is great.  my only nitpick is maybe having another small light shining from the topside of the photo would have lit up the yolk part better</td>', 'great take on the original.  I love the pattern that the red, yellow and white made.  seems to be in pretty good focus and the composition is great.  my only nitpick is maybe having another small light shining from the topside of the photo would have lit up the yolk part better', '2008-02-22 22:50:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(4508708, 648025, 57358, '<td valign="top">beautiful take on the original.  everything is in focus, the composition is great, I love the wood floor and dof... no nitpicks either</td>', 'beautiful take on the original.  everything is in focus, the composition is great, I love the wood floor and dof... no nitpicks either', '2008-02-22 22:53:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(4508711, 649485, 57358, '<td valign="top">hmm... I guess an improvement over the original, but this photo is still very small in size and you can''t hardly see the butter in the photo</td>', 'hmm... I guess an improvement over the original, but this photo is still very small in size and you can''t hardly see the butter in the photo', '2008-02-22 22:54:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(4508718, 648955, 57358, '<td valign="top">beautiful shot.  just the girl over the other subject is an improvement.  I love the sharp focus on her eyes and the apple.  the drops on the apple are also a nice touch.  the only things are that you have some slight haloing and you could have benefitted from a different colored background.  lighting is great</td>', 'beautiful shot.  just the girl over the other subject is an improvement.  I love the sharp focus on her eyes and the apple.  the drops on the apple are also a nice touch.  the only things are that you have some slight haloing and you could have benefitted from a different colored background.  lighting is great', '2008-02-22 22:57:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(4508724, 649770, 57358, '<td valign="top">I like that you used the actual complementary colors - your lighting could have been better... or maybe you used photoshop to turn your background orange.  the orange seems to be flooding onto your model and shadow looks odd.  your focus seems pretty good and I like the composition</td>', 'I like that you used the actual complementary colors - your lighting could have been better... or maybe you used photoshop to turn your background orange.  the orange seems to be flooding onto your model and shadow looks odd.  your focus seems pretty good and I like the composition', '2008-02-22 23:00:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(4508729, 649771, 57358, '<td valign="top">I think you''ve captured the feel that the original photographer was trying to create.  I think this photo is a hard one to redo in the first place.  maybe doing more of a close-up to a particular piece of playground equipment could have given this more interest.  I think you did a great job keeping the focus and the lighting good with such a dark (outside) photo</td>', 'I think you''ve captured the feel that the original photographer was trying to create.  I think this photo is a hard one to redo in the first place.  maybe doing more of a close-up to a particular piece of playground equipment could have given this more interest.  I think you did a great job keeping the focus and the lighting good with such a dark (outside) photo', '2008-02-22 23:02:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(4508734, 649761, 57358, '<td valign="top">nice take on the original - I think your colors could have been brighter and your dof a little deeper.  overall, I like the composition, and the focus where it''s at is pretty sharp</td>', 'nice take on the original - I think your colors could have been brighter and your dof a little deeper.  overall, I like the composition, and the focus where it''s at is pretty sharp', '2008-02-22 23:04:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(4508736, 648809, 57358, '<td valign="top">very nice - I love it.  very sharp, love the selective bright blue, the lighting a little harsh, but I think it suits</td>', 'very nice - I love it.  very sharp, love the selective bright blue, the lighting a little harsh, but I think it suits', '2008-02-22 23:06:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(4508740, 649475, 57358, '<td valign="top">nice take on the original - the background is a little distracting and your keys don''t seem to have much sharpness and could use some more contrast.  the angle is interesting and this is a definite improvement over the original</td>', 'nice take on the original - the background is a little distracting and your keys don''t seem to have much sharpness and could use some more contrast.  the angle is interesting and this is a definite improvement over the original', '2008-02-22 23:07:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(4508745, 649730, 57358, '<td valign="top">very beautiful take on the original.  love your sky though it looks a bit grainy.  your city is perfect, very sharp and perfectly lit.  I think for your personal pic, I would try to clone out the green road sign at the bottom</td>', 'very beautiful take on the original.  love your sky though it looks a bit grainy.  your city is perfect, very sharp and perfectly lit.  I think for your personal pic, I would try to clone out the green road sign at the bottom', '2008-02-22 23:09:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(4508750, 647916, 57358, '<td valign="top">a great remake, but I think it could still use more focus.  hard shot to do into the sun like that</td>', 'a great remake, but I think it could still use more focus.  hard shot to do into the sun like that', '2008-02-22 23:11:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(4508756, 648570, 57358, '<td valign="top">very nice take on the challenge.  everything looks great - very sharp, beautiful colors, no harsh glare on the glass - the only nitpick would be if you could possibly get the background whiter and the contents of the bowl just a tad brighter without affecting the glass reflections</td>', 'very nice take on the challenge.  everything looks great - very sharp, beautiful colors, no harsh glare on the glass - the only nitpick would be if you could possibly get the background whiter and the contents of the bowl just a tad brighter without affecting the glass reflections', '2008-02-22 23:14:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(4508757, 649504, 57358, '<td valign="top">beautiful remake of the original.  very sharp, interesting background, great composition - the only thing is you''re probably getting comments on the light reflections</td>', 'beautiful remake of the original.  very sharp, interesting background, great composition - the only thing is you''re probably getting comments on the light reflections', '2008-02-22 23:15:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(4508760, 649536, 57358, '<td valign="top">wow, this looks almost like the same place as the original.  beautiful remake.  I love your colors, the compostion, the sharpness - even the cloud shadows add interest (also fantastic that your horizon is straight)</td>', 'wow, this looks almost like the same place as the original.  beautiful remake.  I love your colors, the compostion, the sharpness - even the cloud shadows add interest (also fantastic that your horizon is straight)', '2008-02-22 23:18:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(4508762, 648447, 57358, '<td valign="top">beautiful take on the original.  nice and sharp, clean, simple - I like that you added the whisk - lighting is great, no harsh reflections... no nitpicks even</td>', 'beautiful take on the original.  nice and sharp, clean, simple - I like that you added the whisk - lighting is great, no harsh reflections... no nitpicks even', '2008-02-22 23:19:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(4508765, 648930, 57358, '<td valign="top">great remake - love the sharpness on the water droplets, not so sure about the bright yellow in the bottom right corner, but overall this is a great shot</td>', 'great remake - love the sharpness on the water droplets, not so sure about the bright yellow in the bottom right corner, but overall this is a great shot', '2008-02-22 23:21:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(4508769, 649159, 57358, '<td valign="top">beautiful shot (great improvement over the original) - love the silhouettes, the bright color and contrast in the clouds - great angle, even the border looks good and completes the photo</td>', 'beautiful shot (great improvement over the original) - love the silhouettes, the bright color and contrast in the clouds - great angle, even the border looks good and completes the photo', '2008-02-22 23:24:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(4508790, 649633, 77425, '<td valign="top">Thats a beautiful shot and and all, but mixing two different browns gets a DNMC from me.</td>', 'Thats a beautiful shot and and all, but mixing two different browns gets a DNMC from me.', '2008-02-22 23:31:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(4508809, 648930, 77425, '<td valign="top">beautiful shot, but a stretch to be duplicating ''pedal''</td>', 'beautiful shot, but a stretch to be duplicating ''pedal''', '2008-02-22 23:35:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(4508818, 649751, 57358, '<td valign="top">beautiful shot.  great take on the original.  focus on the eyes is nice and sharp, the background is very complementary, great composition, the only thing is I''m wondering if a deeper dof could have gotten his nose in focus too</td>', 'beautiful shot.  great take on the original.  focus on the eyes is nice and sharp, the background is very complementary, great composition, the only thing is I''m wondering if a deeper dof could have gotten his nose in focus too', '2008-02-22 23:37:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(4508827, 649719, 57358, '<td valign="top">nice sharp focus and good dof, I think I would have liked a little different composition - this seems a little off balance, other than that colors are good and angle is nice</td>', 'nice sharp focus and good dof, I think I would have liked a little different composition - this seems a little off balance, other than that colors are good and angle is nice', '2008-02-22 23:40:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(4508832, 649736, 57358, '<td valign="top">very cool that you kept the colors the same as the original - i think you could have gotten sharper focus maybe with a faster shutter speed or more light - great composition... it must have been tough to get your cat to stay in one spot long enough for a quick snap</td>', 'very cool that you kept the colors the same as the original - i think you could have gotten sharper focus maybe with a faster shutter speed or more light - great composition... it must have been tough to get your cat to stay in one spot long enough for a quick snap', '2008-02-22 23:41:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(4508844, 649594, 57358, '<td valign="top">nice, much better than the original. nice sharp focus, very clean and I like that the brownie has good texture.  the subject matter seems a little doomed, but I think you did a great job with it.  I also like your take on the composition</td>', 'nice, much better than the original. nice sharp focus, very clean and I like that the brownie has good texture.  the subject matter seems a little doomed, but I think you did a great job with it.  I also like your take on the composition', '2008-02-22 23:43:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(4508854, 649772, 57358, '<td valign="top">very nice, I especially like that you choose to leave the date out of the remake.  focus is nice and sharp, colors are great, dof just about perfect and the captured action awesome, composition, everything.  very nice</td>', 'very nice, I especially like that you choose to leave the date out of the remake.  focus is nice and sharp, colors are great, dof just about perfect and the captured action awesome, composition, everything.  very nice', '2008-02-22 23:45:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(4508859, 649766, 57358, '<td valign="top">very nice, I like the mirrored effect, nice focus, the only thing is I''d like to see this a little brighter overall - love the composition and colors</td>', 'very nice, I like the mirrored effect, nice focus, the only thing is I''d like to see this a little brighter overall - love the composition and colors', '2008-02-22 23:46:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(4509158, 647503, 68504, '<td valign="top">Not at all: a very becoming shade of green (Babar, the elephant).  Extra points for being square.</td>', 'Not at all: a very becoming shade of green (Babar, the elephant).  Extra points for being square.', '2008-02-23 01:40:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(4509200, 647495, 74533, '<td valign="top">I think it might have been more stunning if the egg yolk was on the red side.  Great simple composition and colours.</td>', 'I think it might have been more stunning if the egg yolk was on the red side.  Great simple composition and colours.', '2008-02-23 02:22:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(4509203, 647503, 74533, '<td valign="top">Is this really a photo of a greeen sheet of paper.</td>', 'Is this really a photo of a greeen sheet of paper.', '2008-02-23 02:24:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(4509205, 649536, 74533, '<td valign="top">Absolutely love this shot.  The colours and lines a beautiful.  So much to look at.</td>', 'Absolutely love this shot.  The colours and lines a beautiful.  So much to look at.', '2008-02-23 02:25:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(4509209, 649485, 74533, '<td valign="top">Whatt!  Very little and very dark.  Cant really make anything out.</td>', 'Whatt!  Very little and very dark.  Cant really make anything out.', '2008-02-23 02:28:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(4509210, 648127, 74533, '<td valign="top">Even thought the purple is pretty, I dont really like it very much.  I think this could have looked great in a high contrast black and white.</td>', 'Even thought the purple is pretty, I dont really like it very much.  I think this could have looked great in a high contrast black and white.', '2008-02-23 02:29:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(4509211, 649786, 74533, '<td valign="top">Beautiful and clear.  I love the colours and the light in the background really suits the shot.</td>', 'Beautiful and clear.  I love the colours and the light in the background really suits the shot.', '2008-02-23 02:29:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(4509213, 649159, 74533, '<td valign="top">I do like this shot. I love the silhouette effect and the sky is beastuiful.  I am not a fan of the thick border.</td>', 'I do like this shot. I love the silhouette effect and the sky is beastuiful.  I am not a fan of the thick border.', '2008-02-23 02:30:48.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(4509214, 649730, 74533, '<td valign="top">What a wonderful shot.  I really like the compposition with the negative space up the top and all of the business down the bottom.</td>', 'What a wonderful shot.  I really like the compposition with the negative space up the top and all of the business down the bottom.', '2008-02-23 02:31:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(4509216, 647916, 74533, '<td valign="top">Nice Contra Jeur shot. A little bright on the eyes perhaps.</td>', 'Nice Contra Jeur shot. A little bright on the eyes perhaps.', '2008-02-23 02:32:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(4509227, 648784, 67258, '<td valign="top">Thanks for making me laugh - the addition to the title is purrfect for this photo!  Not voting, but had to leave a comment here, I love it!</td>', 'Thanks for making me laugh - the addition to the title is purrfect for this photo!  Not voting, but had to leave a comment here, I love it!', '2008-02-23 03:09:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(4509364, 647763, 67258, '<td valign="top">I''m not voting on this challenge, but did want to leave a comment on this one.  This is the first of the 9 entries (and ''browns'') that I have opened so far, and this is the first to remain true to the original.  Kudos to you for the effort, and for showing what a photographer further along the learning curve could do to improve the image. Oh, and as a photo in its own right?  I like it.</td>', 'I''m not voting on this challenge, but did want to leave a comment on this one.  This is the first of the 9 entries (and ''browns'') that I have opened so far, and this is the first to remain true to the original.  Kudos to you for the effort, and for showing what a photographer further along the learning curve could do to improve the image. Oh, and as a photo in its own right?  I like it.', '2008-02-23 05:41:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(4509374, 649732, 66709, '<td valign="top">You changed the background  DNMC</td>', 'You changed the background  DNMC', '2008-02-23 05:59:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(4509375, 649645, 66709, '<td valign="top">dnmc was not closed to the image</td>', 'dnmc was not closed to the image', '2008-02-23 05:59:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(4509377, 649504, 66709, '<td valign="top">Cup is too full</td>', 'Cup is too full', '2008-02-23 06:02:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(4509379, 648809, 66709, '<td valign="top">not exactly to the image  too much face!</td>', 'not exactly to the image  too much face!', '2008-02-23 06:04:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(4509382, 647457, 66709, '<td valign="top">You took a lot of lead way  Whereis the Appliance</td>', 'You took a lot of lead way  Whereis the Appliance', '2008-02-23 06:17:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(4509400, 648622, 30861, '<td valign="top">This is a lovely image, but it bothers me, for this challenge, that you have made no attempt to fit the image into the context of the original challenge, which was "duotones"; had you done a BW conversion into duotone, I''d have scored this near the top.</td>', 'This is a lovely image, but it bothers me, for this challenge, that you have made no attempt to fit the image into the context of the original challenge, which was "duotones"; had you done a BW conversion into duotone, I''d have scored this near the top.', '2008-02-23 06:54:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(4509501, 649600, 66597, '<td valign="top">This is really well done. I hope you place well with this. Not only is it a great replica of the original, it is a beautiful photo. Bump to 9.</td>', 'This is really well done. I hope you place well with this. Not only is it a great replica of the original, it is a beautiful photo. Bump to 9.', '2008-02-23 09:06:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(4509502, 648413, 66597, '<td valign="top">I like it. Very cool.</td>', 'I like it. Very cool.', '2008-02-23 09:06:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(4509503, 648622, 66597, '<td valign="top">This is a gorgeous photo! Look at the depth in that sky. I wouldn''t say it is too close to the original, but close enough. 8.</td>', 'This is a gorgeous photo! Look at the depth in that sky. I wouldn''t say it is too close to the original, but close enough. 8.', '2008-02-23 09:06:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(4509504, 649536, 66597, '<td valign="top">I don''t recall whiterook''s original, but this is a really love redux with great lines, layers and depth. 8.</td>', 'I don''t recall whiterook''s original, but this is a really love redux with great lines, layers and depth. 8.', '2008-02-23 09:06:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(4509507, 647949, 66597, '<td valign="top">This kitty does look awfully pissed off.</td>', 'This kitty does look awfully pissed off.', '2008-02-23 09:07:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(4509508, 649784, 66597, '<td valign="top">Bumping up. I really think this is a cute redux.</td>', 'Bumping up. I really think this is a cute redux.', '2008-02-23 09:07:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(4509509, 648025, 66597, '<td valign="top">This is nicely lit and focused. Problem is, it''s pretty hard to turn a stuffed rabbit and egg into an entrancing photo. But I think you did a good job with what you had, so 7.</td>', 'This is nicely lit and focused. Problem is, it''s pretty hard to turn a stuffed rabbit and egg into an entrancing photo. But I think you did a good job with what you had, so 7.', '2008-02-23 09:07:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(4509511, 648056, 66597, '<td valign="top">I really like the DOF here, but wish the background was less grey. It looks like six dead ladybugs on a piece of paper? I can tell by the way their legs are folded up. Of course, getting six live ladybugs to hold a pose like this would be impossible, so I don''t think you had much choice, LOL.</td>', 'I really like the DOF here, but wish the background was less grey. It looks like six dead ladybugs on a piece of paper? I can tell by the way their legs are folded up. Of course, getting six live ladybugs to hold a pose like this would be impossible, so I don''t think you had much choice, LOL.', '2008-02-23 09:08:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(4509512, 647573, 66597, '<td valign="top">Now this is a true tribute. For some reason, though, I like it, despite lack of much depth, etc. So I''m giving you a decent score just for initial good impression.</td>', 'Now this is a true tribute. For some reason, though, I like it, despite lack of much depth, etc. So I''m giving you a decent score just for initial good impression.', '2008-02-23 09:08:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(4509513, 648127, 66597, '<td valign="top">LOL - I recall that the original in this wasn''t of the White House, either. So even though it''s a shoehorn, it''s a good one in this case.</td>', 'LOL - I recall that the original in this wasn''t of the White House, either. So even though it''s a shoehorn, it''s a good one in this case.', '2008-02-23 09:08:45.000000', NULL, 1),
