(4509516, 648845, 66597, '<td valign="top">Man, it is pretty hard to turn plain rice into an interesting photo. But you have nice focus and good b/w conversion, so decent score.</td>', 'Man, it is pretty hard to turn plain rice into an interesting photo. But you have nice focus and good b/w conversion, so decent score.', '2008-02-23 09:09:19.000000', NULL, 1),
