(4509522, 649485, 66597, '<td valign="top">I can''t decide whether to give you a 10 or a 1. Okay, I''ll go with the 1. Nope, make that a 2 - I do like the "buttery" frame.</td>', 'I can''t decide whether to give you a 10 or a 1. Okay, I''ll go with the 1. Nope, make that a 2 - I do like the "buttery" frame.', '2008-02-23 09:10:17.000000', NULL, 1),
