(4509614, 649736, 67697, '<td valign="top">I hope you don''t take this the wrong way, but my preference is actually the original photo.  There''s something particularly spooky in that one with it looking like the kitty is ready to leap at you.  This one it looks like kitty is ready to scratch out the carpet.  Nice imitation of color tho!</td>', 'I hope you don''t take this the wrong way, but my preference is actually the original photo.  There''s something particularly spooky in that one with it looking like the kitty is ready to leap at you.  This one it looks like kitty is ready to scratch out the carpet.  Nice imitation of color tho!', '2008-02-23 10:29:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(4509618, 649784, 1024, '<td valign="top">This is a great tribute shot to one of the all time famous from Jacko.  You did him proud.</td>', 'This is a great tribute shot to one of the all time famous from Jacko.  You did him proud.', '2008-02-23 10:30:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(4509620, 648602, 67697, '<td valign="top">Your title is wrong.  It looks like a dead seagul on the beach.  :)  4</td>', 'Your title is wrong.  It looks like a dead seagul on the beach.  :)  4', '2008-02-23 10:34:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(4509621, 647503, 67697, '<td valign="top">Ahhh wish I had thought of this.  To add the border is brilliant!  In the original, your eye wandered all over the screen.  Now the border helps the eye to focus on something.  However, your I would have preferred to see even thickness on all sides of the border.  Since some of the sides are out of balance, I cannot give you a higher than a 4.  :)</td>', 'Ahhh wish I had thought of this.  To add the border is brilliant!  In the original, your eye wandered all over the screen.  Now the border helps the eye to focus on something.  However, your I would have preferred to see even thickness on all sides of the border.  Since some of the sides are out of balance, I cannot give you a higher than a 4.  :)', '2008-02-23 10:34:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(4509638, 648413, 67697, '<td valign="top">Well this would certainly explain the strange glow in the eastern night sky.  :)  I was wondering if one of you Cleveland area people was gonna take this on.  I would say that yes, there''s more to look at in this one than the original lol.  It''s nice that you included the stadium too.</td>', 'Well this would certainly explain the strange glow in the eastern night sky.  :)  I was wondering if one of you Cleveland area people was gonna take this on.  I would say that yes, there''s more to look at in this one than the original lol.  It''s nice that you included the stadium too.', '2008-02-23 10:52:07.000000', NULL, 1),
