(4509752, 648845, 89479, '<td valign="top">Thats really cool. I never realized rice could make a cool abstract. Very nice.</td>', 'Thats really cool. I never realized rice could make a cool abstract. Very nice.', '2008-02-23 12:13:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(4509880, 649600, 57358, '<td valign="top">very nice, your kitty''s eyes and face are nice and sharp, composition is great, I like your upclose crop and how the paw looks like it''s coming toward the apple.  the only thing is I''m wondering if a deeper dof could have brought the apple a little more in focus, I also like that the colors of the apple are reflecting in the eyes and complementing the kitty''s natural color</td>', 'very nice, your kitty''s eyes and face are nice and sharp, composition is great, I like your upclose crop and how the paw looks like it''s coming toward the apple.  the only thing is I''m wondering if a deeper dof could have brought the apple a little more in focus, I also like that the colors of the apple are reflecting in the eyes and complementing the kitty''s natural color', '2008-02-23 13:37:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(4509883, 649511, 57358, '<td valign="top">very nice remake, love your colors, brightness and contrast.  may be a little oversharpened, but dpc responds well to that, great bokeh too btw, I love the circles in the background</td>', 'very nice remake, love your colors, brightness and contrast.  may be a little oversharpened, but dpc responds well to that, great bokeh too btw, I love the circles in the background', '2008-02-23 13:40:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(4509886, 649774, 57358, '<td valign="top">yikes, there are a lot of pictures with this title - I found it though.  I like that you managed to still use greens and blues like in the original, but make it look good.  composition is great, I like that you got good sharpness on the drop and softness on the rest.  the only nitpick is that I''m not so fond of the rusty brown color... everything is is perfect</td>', 'yikes, there are a lot of pictures with this title - I found it though.  I like that you managed to still use greens and blues like in the original, but make it look good.  composition is great, I like that you got good sharpness on the drop and softness on the rest.  the only nitpick is that I''m not so fond of the rusty brown color... everything is is perfect', '2008-02-23 13:44:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(4509888, 649768, 57358, '<td valign="top">technically a very nice photo, nice remake of the original, focus and composition are both great, the only thing is it needs a little something extra - maybe more color or something, I''m not sure, overall very well done</td>', 'technically a very nice photo, nice remake of the original, focus and composition are both great, the only thing is it needs a little something extra - maybe more color or something, I''m not sure, overall very well done', '2008-02-23 13:47:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(4509891, 649221, 57358, '<td valign="top">very beautiful, great take on the original, clean, simple, sharp (talking about the focus), love the composition and colors. perfect</td>', 'very beautiful, great take on the original, clean, simple, sharp (talking about the focus), love the composition and colors. perfect', '2008-02-23 13:50:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(4509897, 648602, 57358, '<td valign="top">hmm.. interesting take on the original.  I think that considering your subject, the faded-out editing was a good choice.  composition is good, maybe a little more space below the wing would help a little.  I''m guessing though, that this isn''t doing so well with the dpc crowd - I''m wondering if maybe you couldn''t have tried other angles like from the ground view, or upclose maybe on the wing or with feathers blowing in the wind, but obviously lifeless on the ground...  not sure, just some thoughts</td>', 'hmm.. interesting take on the original.  I think that considering your subject, the faded-out editing was a good choice.  composition is good, maybe a little more space below the wing would help a little.  I''m guessing though, that this isn''t doing so well with the dpc crowd - I''m wondering if maybe you couldn''t have tried other angles like from the ground view, or upclose maybe on the wing or with feathers blowing in the wind, but obviously lifeless on the ground...  not sure, just some thoughts', '2008-02-23 13:57:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(4509904, 648323, 57358, '<td valign="top">good remake of the original, looks like focus is good and the chess set is beautiful, the only thing is I''m wondering if maybe you took this from more of a ground level with the pieces, the board wouldn''t be so confusing with the pieces - in this challenge, we didn''t have to follow the rules of the original challenge</td>', 'good remake of the original, looks like focus is good and the chess set is beautiful, the only thing is I''m wondering if maybe you took this from more of a ground level with the pieces, the board wouldn''t be so confusing with the pieces - in this challenge, we didn''t have to follow the rules of the original challenge', '2008-02-23 14:00:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(4509909, 648878, 57358, '<td valign="top">nice remake, I like the b&amp;w and good sharpness on the apple.  I''m wondering if a slightly deeper dof could have gotten your kitty''s nose a little more in focus.  also, for the dpc crowd, maybe cropping way in so that you have a square with just the kitty''s face and partial neck and half the top of the apple might have done better.  great capture though, I love the look in those eyes</td>', 'nice remake, I like the b&w and good sharpness on the apple.  I''m wondering if a slightly deeper dof could have gotten your kitty''s nose a little more in focus.  also, for the dpc crowd, maybe cropping way in so that you have a square with just the kitty''s face and partial neck and half the top of the apple might have done better.  great capture though, I love the look in those eyes', '2008-02-23 14:03:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(4510231, 649775, 77196, '<td valign="top">Huh? K x R</td>', 'Huh? K x R', '2008-02-23 16:04:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(4510302, 649775, 57358, '<td valign="top">nice take on the original, it must have been hard to get enough lighting on the board without blowing out the pieces, I''m wondering if you could''ve tried lighting from below the board with a little bit of light from above.  the only other nitpicky thing would be that the glass is dusty.  I tried messing around with this in photoshop and it has real potential - I would try converting to b&amp;w and using dodge/burn to even out the lighting, and selective highlighting on the squares to get rid of dust, darken black squares and lighten white squares.  this is a very good start, good luck in the challenge</td>', 'nice take on the original, it must have been hard to get enough lighting on the board without blowing out the pieces, I''m wondering if you could''ve tried lighting from below the board with a little bit of light from above.  the only other nitpicky thing would be that the glass is dusty.  I tried messing around with this in photoshop and it has real potential - I would try converting to b&w and using dodge/burn to even out the lighting, and selective highlighting on the squares to get rid of dust, darken black squares and lighten white squares.  this is a very good start, good luck in the challenge', '2008-02-23 16:21:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(4510309, 649784, 57358, '<td valign="top">what a cool capture, must have been hard to keep the cat in the frame let alone anything else.  maybe a faster shutter speed, more light and a deeper dof could help you get a sharper focus.  I like the composition and your colors</td>', 'what a cool capture, must have been hard to keep the cat in the frame let alone anything else.  maybe a faster shutter speed, more light and a deeper dof could help you get a sharper focus.  I like the composition and your colors', '2008-02-23 16:23:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(4510323, 647708, 57358, '<td valign="top">very nice, interesting silverware, great background, good colors, no harsh reflections, the only nitpick is I wonder what this would look like if the pieces were separated a bit - might not be better though, great job overall</td>', 'very nice, interesting silverware, great background, good colors, no harsh reflections, the only nitpick is I wonder what this would look like if the pieces were separated a bit - might not be better though, great job overall', '2008-02-23 16:25:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(4510337, 647503, 57358, '<td valign="top">well, that''s a beautiful even green.  no grain, can''t tell about the focus... like that you added a border... however, I think you know how this is gonna go  : )  good luck in the challenge</td>', 'well, that''s a beautiful even green.  no grain, can''t tell about the focus... like that you added a border... however, I think you know how this is gonna go  : )  good luck in the challenge', '2008-02-23 16:29:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(4510345, 649645, 57358, '<td valign="top">well, very interesting photo, technically well done, good color, clean, nice lighting, I definitely like this better than the original</td>', 'well, very interesting photo, technically well done, good color, clean, nice lighting, I definitely like this better than the original', '2008-02-23 16:32:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(4510349, 648471, 57358, '<td valign="top">much better than the original, I''m concerned if this is actually your ceiling.  I think you did a great job considering the subject matter you were working with.  I think the only thing I would like is for the lighting to be a little more even, not too much though because I like how it goes from bright to dark from the corner</td>', 'much better than the original, I''m concerned if this is actually your ceiling.  I think you did a great job considering the subject matter you were working with.  I think the only thing I would like is for the lighting to be a little more even, not too much though because I like how it goes from bright to dark from the corner', '2008-02-23 16:34:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(4510350, 649782, 57358, '<td valign="top">very nice, sharp focus, smooth rich colors, love the long exposure, I think the only thing is I would prefer a non-labeled bottle, great job overall</td>', 'very nice, sharp focus, smooth rich colors, love the long exposure, I think the only thing is I would prefer a non-labeled bottle, great job overall', '2008-02-23 16:37:01.000000', NULL, 1),
