(4510376, 647763, 57358, '<td valign="top">very nice remake, love the color and the compostion with a clean background, the only thing is that I''d like a little more light or brightness on the flowers, everything else is great</td>', 'very nice remake, love the color and the compostion with a clean background, the only thing is that I''d like a little more light or brightness on the flowers, everything else is great', '2008-02-23 16:44:26.000000', NULL, 1),
