(4510390, 649240, 57358, '<td valign="top">great take on the original, I love the action of the water droplets and the nice clean background, the only thing is I wish there were more light on the flower, nice sharp focus, I love that I can almost feel how silky the petals are, great job overall</td>', 'great take on the original, I love the action of the water droplets and the nice clean background, the only thing is I wish there were more light on the flower, nice sharp focus, I love that I can almost feel how silky the petals are, great job overall', '2008-02-23 16:50:27.000000', NULL, 1),
