(4522138, 648610, 83313, '<td valign="top">Can''t locate the brownie that this is emulating, but I like it. (In spite of the subtle meanings escaping me) The treatment of the door and brickwork especially appeals to me.</td>', 'Can''t locate the brownie that this is emulating, but I like it. (In spite of the subtle meanings escaping me) The treatment of the door and brickwork especially appeals to me.', '2008-02-27 13:20:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(4522148, 649633, 83313, '<td valign="top">Does not look much like either of the brownies it is emulating, but it''s good.</td>', 'Does not look much like either of the brownies it is emulating, but it''s good.', '2008-02-27 13:22:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(4522159, 648056, 83313, '<td valign="top">Well, it''s better than the brownie it emulates, but the lighting is similar (not a good thing, I''m afraid). Better lighting would have really helped here.</td>', 'Well, it''s better than the brownie it emulates, but the lighting is similar (not a good thing, I''m afraid). Better lighting would have really helped here.', '2008-02-27 13:25:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(4522172, 647573, 83313, '<td valign="top">Kind of grainy and not a lot of contrast. I can''t locate the original brownie to compare it to.</td>', 'Kind of grainy and not a lot of contrast. I can''t locate the original brownie to compare it to.', '2008-02-27 13:32:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(4522174, 647708, 83313, '<td valign="top">Nice and bright and clear.</td>', 'Nice and bright and clear.', '2008-02-27 13:35:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(4522183, 648784, 83313, '<td valign="top">Looks kind of playful to me. A lot of high ISO grain.</td>', 'Looks kind of playful to me. A lot of high ISO grain.', '2008-02-27 13:38:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(4522188, 648878, 83313, '<td valign="top">Awwww!</td>', 'Awwww!', '2008-02-27 13:39:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(4522290, 648570, 811, '<td valign="top">nice colors -- very rich</td>', 'nice colors -- very rich', '2008-02-27 14:13:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(4522442, 649736, 30982, '<td valign="top">Excellent!  This really does justice to the spirit of the original.  Love the wild colors!</td>', 'Excellent!  This really does justice to the spirit of the original.  Love the wild colors!', '2008-02-27 15:08:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(4522446, 649784, 30982, '<td valign="top">Wonderful expression!!  Another good take on the Jacko classic.</td>', 'Wonderful expression!!  Another good take on the Jacko classic.', '2008-02-27 15:09:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(4522485, 649600, 30982, '<td valign="top">Very cool how the apple is so well reflected in the eye.  An excellent shot on it''s own.</td>', 'Very cool how the apple is so well reflected in the eye.  An excellent shot on it''s own.', '2008-02-27 15:17:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(4522487, 648413, 30982, '<td valign="top">Cool take on the challenge!!</td>', 'Cool take on the challenge!!', '2008-02-27 15:18:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(4522491, 648878, 30982, '<td valign="top">This must be a shared kitty.  I like this version as well.  In particular, I really like the focus on the apple rather than the kitty.</td>', 'This must be a shared kitty.  I like this version as well.  In particular, I really like the focus on the apple rather than the kitty.', '2008-02-27 15:19:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(4522710, 649775, 90658, '<td valign="top">Cropping at bottom is odd, I don''t like the straight angle on the left and the variances of the squares on the right.  Either all 90 degrees of keep things on the angle.</td>', 'Cropping at bottom is odd, I don''t like the straight angle on the left and the variances of the squares on the right.  Either all 90 degrees of keep things on the angle.', '2008-02-27 16:53:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(4522711, 649235, 90658, '<td valign="top">Interesting.  It''s hard to tell the bottom from the clock with the face of the clock.</td>', 'Interesting.  It''s hard to tell the bottom from the clock with the face of the clock.', '2008-02-27 16:53:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(4522712, 648878, 90658, '<td valign="top">My eyes are drawn to the blank space between the apple and the kitty.  Perhaps a different angle on this shot would have brought definition to the "purpose" of the shot.</td>', 'My eyes are drawn to the blank space between the apple and the kitty.  Perhaps a different angle on this shot would have brought definition to the "purpose" of the shot.', '2008-02-27 16:53:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(4522714, 647796, 90658, '<td valign="top">I like, I like, I like.  Only suggestion, too much black space at the top.</td>', 'I like, I like, I like.  Only suggestion, too much black space at the top.', '2008-02-27 16:53:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(4522716, 648056, 90658, '<td valign="top">I think the angle of this shot, detracts from the message.  Maybe the cropping...it''s hard to put my finger on what causes me a sense of uncomfortableness when I look at this.  Others will probably love it, I guess that''s art, though.</td>', 'I think the angle of this shot, detracts from the message.  Maybe the cropping...it''s hard to put my finger on what causes me a sense of uncomfortableness when I look at this.  Others will probably love it, I guess that''s art, though.', '2008-02-27 16:53:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(4522718, 649633, 90658, '<td valign="top">Fabulous!  Weird stem at the bottom.</td>', 'Fabulous!  Weird stem at the bottom.', '2008-02-27 16:54:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(4522719, 649770, 90658, '<td valign="top">As this is advanced editting, I would like to see the dark shadow go away.  Keep the varing stages of yellow.</td>', 'As this is advanced editting, I would like to see the dark shadow go away.  Keep the varing stages of yellow.', '2008-02-27 16:54:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(4522720, 649221, 90658, '<td valign="top">Oh!  It''s a knife being washed.  Love the water action.</td>', 'Oh!  It''s a knife being washed.  Love the water action.', '2008-02-27 16:54:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(4522721, 649570, 90658, '<td valign="top">Well done, perhaps a wider shot on the sink.  Give the impression of "biggness."</td>', 'Well done, perhaps a wider shot on the sink.  Give the impression of "biggness."', '2008-02-27 16:54:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(4522722, 649736, 90658, '<td valign="top">Not knowing what the original looked like, I can''t comment as to the improvement.  In general, this is too grainy for me.</td>', 'Not knowing what the original looked like, I can''t comment as to the improvement.  In general, this is too grainy for me.', '2008-02-27 16:54:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(4522724, 649751, 90658, '<td valign="top">Ahhhhhh!  The eyes seem dead to me.</td>', 'Ahhhhhh!  The eyes seem dead to me.', '2008-02-27 16:54:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(4522727, 649781, 90658, '<td valign="top">Very nice.  I would have like a sharper image.  Sometimes flowers are more stunning in relief as opposed to soft focus.</td>', 'Very nice.  I would have like a sharper image.  Sometimes flowers are more stunning in relief as opposed to soft focus.', '2008-02-27 16:54:50.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(4522729, 649159, 90658, '<td valign="top">My eyes had to work really hard to find the focal point of this shot.  Is it the sunset, the silouhette, the storm clouds?  Once I focused on the sunset, the picture jumped, but if I weren''t "voting", I''d skip it altogether.</td>', 'My eyes had to work really hard to find the focal point of this shot.  Is it the sunset, the silouhette, the storm clouds?  Once I focused on the sunset, the picture jumped, but if I weren''t "voting", I''d skip it altogether.', '2008-02-27 16:55:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(4522730, 648570, 90658, '<td valign="top">Well done!  I really like this.  This could be a favorite.</td>', 'Well done!  I really like this.  This could be a favorite.', '2008-02-27 16:55:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(4522731, 649536, 90658, '<td valign="top">Hmmm!  Did you add the water?  I feel like I''m looking at two pictures instead of one cohesive idea.  Honestly, you could have just cropped the entire top half off and been left with a stunning and simple shot of the fence and sand.</td>', 'Hmmm!  Did you add the water?  I feel like I''m looking at two pictures instead of one cohesive idea.  Honestly, you could have just cropped the entire top half off and been left with a stunning and simple shot of the fence and sand.', '2008-02-27 16:55:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(4522733, 648127, 90658, '<td valign="top">Color not to my liking, but you can''t please everyone.  I feel as if the building is collapsing in on itself...look at the foundation angles.</td>', 'Color not to my liking, but you can''t please everyone.  I feel as if the building is collapsing in on itself...look at the foundation angles.', '2008-02-27 16:55:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(4522734, 649771, 90658, '<td valign="top">I would have changed the depth of field so as not to see the tree trunk right in the middle.</td>', 'I would have changed the depth of field so as not to see the tree trunk right in the middle.', '2008-02-27 16:55:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(4522735, 649600, 90658, '<td valign="top">Nicely done.  Colors are wonderful.</td>', 'Nicely done.  Colors are wonderful.', '2008-02-27 16:55:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(4522737, 648809, 90658, '<td valign="top">Stunning!</td>', 'Stunning!', '2008-02-27 16:56:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(4522738, 647403, 90658, '<td valign="top">I can''t get past the gross nose hairs.</td>', 'I can''t get past the gross nose hairs.', '2008-02-27 16:56:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(4522739, 649747, 90658, '<td valign="top">Lighting on this really shows the fingerprints on the wristband.</td>', 'Lighting on this really shows the fingerprints on the wristband.', '2008-02-27 16:56:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(4522740, 648323, 90658, '<td valign="top">First of all, interesting chess board.  Not the best way to show it off.  Perhaps some angle work...like a perfect 45 degree angle.</td>', 'First of all, interesting chess board.  Not the best way to show it off.  Perhaps some angle work...like a perfect 45 degree angle.', '2008-02-27 16:56:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(4522741, 648057, 90658, '<td valign="top">Too muted and soft.  The kitty is soft, the carpet is soft, the focus is soft.  I don''t see the excercise of juxtaposing "textures."</td>', 'Too muted and soft.  The kitty is soft, the carpet is soft, the focus is soft.  I don''t see the excercise of juxtaposing "textures."', '2008-02-27 16:56:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(4522742, 649732, 90658, '<td valign="top">This just seems boring.  Perhaps on a differnet background.  Watch the reflections.</td>', 'This just seems boring.  Perhaps on a differnet background.  Watch the reflections.', '2008-02-27 16:56:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(4522743, 648533, 90658, '<td valign="top">Colors a great, perhaps it is lacking in depth.  There is something that puts this the category of "accidental" success.</td>', 'Colors a great, perhaps it is lacking in depth.  There is something that puts this the category of "accidental" success.', '2008-02-27 16:56:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(4522744, 649719, 90658, '<td valign="top">Generally, a good effort.  For me, it just doesn''t pop.</td>', 'Generally, a good effort.  For me, it just doesn''t pop.', '2008-02-27 16:56:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(4522746, 649698, 90658, '<td valign="top">You know, when I saw this as a thumnail I thought "that''s going to be cool."  As I see this in real size, I get the idea, but every piano playing ballerina, college student, girlie-girl has a print of this in their dorm rooms...minus the rose, toe shoes or cutsey saying.</td>', 'You know, when I saw this as a thumnail I thought "that''s going to be cool."  As I see this in real size, I get the idea, but every piano playing ballerina, college student, girlie-girl has a print of this in their dorm rooms...minus the rose, toe shoes or cutsey saying.', '2008-02-27 16:57:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(4522747, 648447, 90658, '<td valign="top">Colors pop!</td>', 'Colors pop!', '2008-02-27 16:57:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(4522753, 649475, 90658, '<td valign="top">This is an interesting take on the typical keyboard shot.  I would like more definition between the keys.</td>', 'This is an interesting take on the typical keyboard shot.  I would like more definition between the keys.', '2008-02-27 16:58:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(4522754, 649594, 90658, '<td valign="top">I like!  Cropping would be more effective, if the entire brownie was visible.</td>', 'I like!  Cropping would be more effective, if the entire brownie was visible.', '2008-02-27 16:58:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(4522756, 648602, 90658, '<td valign="top">Unfortuantely, I just don''t get it.  Art is like that, some get it, some don''t.  The problem is when those that don''t, just don''t like it either.  This is a picture that if I saw in a gallary or store, I would walk right on by.  I wouldn''t even stop and take the time to say, "I don''t get it."</td>', 'Unfortuantely, I just don''t get it.  Art is like that, some get it, some don''t.  The problem is when those that don''t, just don''t like it either.  This is a picture that if I saw in a gallary or store, I would walk right on by.  I wouldn''t even stop and take the time to say, "I don''t get it."', '2008-02-27 16:59:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(4522758, 647949, 90658, '<td valign="top">Animal shots are so difficult to get right.  This one is about 80% right.  The eyes are too washed out for the picture to have that "Wow" factor.</td>', 'Animal shots are so difficult to get right.  This one is about 80% right.  The eyes are too washed out for the picture to have that "Wow" factor.', '2008-02-27 16:59:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(4522759, 649730, 90658, '<td valign="top">Interesting, I feel like I''m looking at two different pictures here.  Either one would be stunning, but together it leaves me cold.</td>', 'Interesting, I feel like I''m looking at two different pictures here.  Either one would be stunning, but together it leaves me cold.', '2008-02-27 16:59:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(4522760, 647457, 90658, '<td valign="top">Where''s the butter?  Good title.  I really had to work hard to see the subject of this shot.  Either black &amp; white wasn''t the way to go, or there is something hidden that you don''t want us to see...it is really busy in the corners, leading me to think that you are hiding something.  This detracts from the butter.</td>', 'Where''s the butter?  Good title.  I really had to work hard to see the subject of this shot.  Either black & white wasn''t the way to go, or there is something hidden that you don''t want us to see...it is really busy in the corners, leading me to think that you are hiding something.  This detracts from the butter.', '2008-02-27 16:59:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(4522761, 649645, 90658, '<td valign="top">For some reason, I tried to open the card to read the punchline.  There is alot going on in this picture, none of it is working together.  The hand holding the scissors...fantastic angles.  The face...too intense for the funny.  The tie...as a subject unto itself, very well captured.  To be perfectly honest, my eyes go directly to the stomach.</td>', 'For some reason, I tried to open the card to read the punchline.  There is alot going on in this picture, none of it is working together.  The hand holding the scissors...fantastic angles.  The face...too intense for the funny.  The tie...as a subject unto itself, very well captured.  To be perfectly honest, my eyes go directly to the stomach.', '2008-02-27 17:00:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(4522762, 647763, 90658, '<td valign="top">I prefer sharper contrast between the foreground and the background.</td>', 'I prefer sharper contrast between the foreground and the background.', '2008-02-27 17:00:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(4522763, 648845, 90658, '<td valign="top">Thanks for the clarification.  I thought they were little buggies.  Perhaps the transparency effect was not the best...</td>', 'Thanks for the clarification.  I thought they were little buggies.  Perhaps the transparency effect was not the best...', '2008-02-27 17:00:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(4522764, 647708, 90658, '<td valign="top">The relection almost negates the design of the handles, thus it seems busy.</td>', 'The relection almost negates the design of the handles, thus it seems busy.', '2008-02-27 17:00:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(4522766, 648930, 90658, '<td valign="top">Beautiful shot.  The lime green at the bottom is a stark contrast to the rest of the shot...I would have like to see a more gradual change between the two.</td>', 'Beautiful shot.  The lime green at the bottom is a stark contrast to the rest of the shot...I would have like to see a more gradual change between the two.', '2008-02-27 17:00:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(4522768, 647916, 90658, '<td valign="top">Not really sure why I have a visual problem with this.  Perhaps it is the chopped off thumb and weird "chunkiness" of the hand.</td>', 'Not really sure why I have a visual problem with this.  Perhaps it is the chopped off thumb and weird "chunkiness" of the hand.', '2008-02-27 17:00:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(4522769, 648610, 90658, '<td valign="top">This is nice.  The title doesn''t do too much for it.  I expected to see an expression on the women, that was a little more Hitchcock.</td>', 'This is nice.  The title doesn''t do too much for it.  I expected to see an expression on the women, that was a little more Hitchcock.', '2008-02-27 17:01:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(4522770, 647503, 90658, '<td valign="top">This is getting into modern art, and not the good kind.</td>', 'This is getting into modern art, and not the good kind.', '2008-02-27 17:01:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(4522772, 649782, 90658, '<td valign="top">The house doesn''t fit in this shot.</td>', 'The house doesn''t fit in this shot.', '2008-02-27 17:01:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(4522773, 648025, 90658, '<td valign="top">This shot actually would have been better served without the purple bunny.</td>', 'This shot actually would have been better served without the purple bunny.', '2008-02-27 17:01:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(4522775, 648955, 90658, '<td valign="top">I like this one.  The skewer should be more in focus.</td>', 'I like this one.  The skewer should be more in focus.', '2008-02-27 17:01:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(4522777, 648413, 90658, '<td valign="top">Interesting.  A little less rocks, more city.</td>', 'Interesting.  A little less rocks, more city.', '2008-02-27 17:01:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(4522780, 648325, 90658, '<td valign="top">I like the pure enjoyment that was captured here.  Unfortunately, it seems like a snapshot instead of an editorial picture.</td>', 'I like the pure enjoyment that was captured here.  Unfortunately, it seems like a snapshot instead of an editorial picture.', '2008-02-27 17:01:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(4522781, 649737, 90658, '<td valign="top">Too much wetness.  Are these juicy pieces of fruit or fruit under water?</td>', 'Too much wetness.  Are these juicy pieces of fruit or fruit under water?', '2008-02-27 17:02:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(4522783, 649768, 90658, '<td valign="top">The apple seems photoshopped into the picture....see the stark lines on the right.</td>', 'The apple seems photoshopped into the picture....see the stark lines on the right.', '2008-02-27 17:02:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(4522784, 649786, 90658, '<td valign="top">The idea is wonderful.  The execution of the blue is great.  The bear makes it seem thrown together.</td>', 'The idea is wonderful.  The execution of the blue is great.  The bear makes it seem thrown together.', '2008-02-27 17:02:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(4522785, 649387, 90658, '<td valign="top">I think that soft focus detracts from the impact.</td>', 'I think that soft focus detracts from the impact.', '2008-02-27 17:02:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(4522786, 648622, 90658, '<td valign="top">Very well done!</td>', 'Very well done!', '2008-02-27 17:02:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(4522787, 647573, 90658, '<td valign="top">This shot seems to soft to my eyes.</td>', 'This shot seems to soft to my eyes.', '2008-02-27 17:02:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(4522789, 649240, 90658, '<td valign="top">Well done!  I prefer more contrast bewteen lights &amp; darks</td>', 'Well done!  I prefer more contrast bewteen lights & darks', '2008-02-27 17:02:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(4522790, 647681, 90658, '<td valign="top">So simple, so elegent.  This is great.</td>', 'So simple, so elegent.  This is great.', '2008-02-27 17:03:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(4522791, 648979, 90658, '<td valign="top">Watch the reflections.  I can see the room and your flash, not the point of the shot, I''m sure.</td>', 'Watch the reflections.  I can see the room and your flash, not the point of the shot, I''m sure.', '2008-02-27 17:03:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(4522793, 648566, 90658, '<td valign="top">Too much background.  Watch your DOF.  Good job catching the texural differences.</td>', 'Too much background.  Watch your DOF.  Good job catching the texural differences.', '2008-02-27 17:03:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(4522794, 649485, 90658, '<td valign="top">Wish I could.  Way too dark, way too small.</td>', 'Wish I could.  Way too dark, way too small.', '2008-02-27 17:03:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(4522795, 647495, 90658, '<td valign="top">I like this take on the shot.  The colors are extraordinary.</td>', 'I like this take on the shot.  The colors are extraordinary.', '2008-02-27 17:03:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(4522797, 649761, 90658, '<td valign="top">Are the colors in this flower really this muted?  You captured the texture, but the essence is missing.</td>', 'Are the colors in this flower really this muted?  You captured the texture, but the essence is missing.', '2008-02-27 17:03:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(4522798, 647930, 90658, '<td valign="top">The white wedge between the slices is distracting.  Perhaps a softer DOF or a different background color.</td>', 'The white wedge between the slices is distracting.  Perhaps a softer DOF or a different background color.', '2008-02-27 17:03:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(4522799, 649766, 90658, '<td valign="top">The relection is nice.  I really like the effect.  Perhaps too much orange in the editing.  It makes it a little difficult to differentiate.</td>', 'The relection is nice.  I really like the effect.  Perhaps too much orange in the editing.  It makes it a little difficult to differentiate.', '2008-02-27 17:04:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(4522801, 649504, 90658, '<td valign="top">Well done!  The swirls opposite the grain of the table are great.  Perhaps the handle should be more on the diagonal and I''m not sure the white mug is the best color.</td>', 'Well done!  The swirls opposite the grain of the table are great.  Perhaps the handle should be more on the diagonal and I''m not sure the white mug is the best color.', '2008-02-27 17:04:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(4522802, 648784, 90658, '<td valign="top">Too grainy for my tastes.  A lot of stuff going on in the right side of the shot.</td>', 'Too grainy for my tastes.  A lot of stuff going on in the right side of the shot.', '2008-02-27 17:04:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(4522803, 648471, 90658, '<td valign="top">Wow!  That''s a ceiling, I thought it was a sandy area.  I really like the simplicity of this.  I wonder what it would like in sepia.</td>', 'Wow!  That''s a ceiling, I thought it was a sandy area.  I really like the simplicity of this.  I wonder what it would like in sepia.', '2008-02-27 17:04:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(4522804, 648986, 90658, '<td valign="top">Nicely done!  The reflection adds a lot.  I would experiment with shell placement in order to avoid the mouse ears look.</td>', 'Nicely done!  The reflection adds a lot.  I would experiment with shell placement in order to avoid the mouse ears look.', '2008-02-27 17:04:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(4522805, 649772, 90658, '<td valign="top">I like this shot.  I would prefer to see the drain either further to the left or more centered.</td>', 'I like this shot.  I would prefer to see the drain either further to the left or more centered.', '2008-02-27 17:04:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(4522806, 649784, 90658, '<td valign="top">Interesting view.  I get the panning to show action, but I think more focus on the eyes would have really made this one.</td>', 'Interesting view.  I get the panning to show action, but I think more focus on the eyes would have really made this one.', '2008-02-27 17:04:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(4522808, 649572, 90658, '<td valign="top">Easily the best recreation of this one.  Well done!</td>', 'Easily the best recreation of this one.  Well done!', '2008-02-27 17:05:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(4522809, 649774, 90658, '<td valign="top">I prefer more color contrast, but that is just me.  Nice focus on the water drop.</td>', 'I prefer more color contrast, but that is just me.  Nice focus on the water drop.', '2008-02-27 17:05:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(4522811, 649613, 90658, '<td valign="top">Haunting shot!  More lighting on the cross and this would be stunning.</td>', 'Haunting shot!  More lighting on the cross and this would be stunning.', '2008-02-27 17:05:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(4522812, 649511, 90658, '<td valign="top">Well done!  Is it possible to "get rid" of more of the background?</td>', 'Well done!  Is it possible to "get rid" of more of the background?', '2008-02-27 17:05:28.000000', NULL, 1),
