(4527017, 647457, 30982, '<td valign="top">Too funny!!  And somehow I missed the original - that was an excellent idea.  I like how you''ve extended that - to make us think that after the door closes, a wee bit of light remains trapped for at least a second or two!  And if it weren''t for that Fearless Leader of ours, we''d be neighbors again.</td>', 'Too funny!!  And somehow I missed the original - that was an excellent idea.  I like how you''ve extended that - to make us think that after the door closes, a wee bit of light remains trapped for at least a second or two!  And if it weren''t for that Fearless Leader of ours, we''d be neighbors again.', '2008-02-29 04:41:08.000000', NULL, 0),
(4527018, 647503, 30982, '<td valign="top">I''m sitting here laughing so hard there are tears running down my face, and I''m at work!  All your fault!  I love your processing steps and the thought process that went into improving Mr Baker''s already exceptional challenge entry.  Two big thumbs up on this one.</td>', 'I''m sitting here laughing so hard there are tears running down my face, and I''m at work!  All your fault!  I love your processing steps and the thought process that went into improving Mr Baker''s already exceptional challenge entry.  Two big thumbs up on this one.', '2008-02-29 04:43:16.000000', NULL, 0),
