(4527200, 648878, 30982, '<td valign="top">So apparently this is not a shared cat.  The similarities between your cat and the cat who modeled for[user] cheekymunky[/user] are quite striking.  I didn''t vote the challenge, but I did peruse, and I really like this shot a lot.  Excellent composition - keeps the same storyline as the original but with a different flavor.  Your cat is very well behaved as a model!</td>', 'So apparently this is not a shared cat.  The similarities between your cat and the cat who modeled for[user] cheekymunky[/user] are quite striking.  I didn''t vote the challenge, but I did peruse, and I really like this shot a lot.  Excellent composition - keeps the same storyline as the original but with a different flavor.  Your cat is very well behaved as a model!', '2008-02-29 06:53:15.000000', NULL, 0),
