(4527270, 648878, 40973, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Melethia:</b></div><hr/><i> So apparently this is not a shared cat.  The similarities between your cat and the cat who modeled for[user] cheekymunky[/user] are quite striking.  I didn''t vote the challenge, but I did peruse, and I really like this shot a lot.  Excellent composition - keeps the same storyline as the original but with a different flavor.  Your cat is very well behaved as a model! </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Sometimes catnip works and sometimes it doesn''t. This was a brief interlude of tranquility of a drug crazed model and many hopelessly blurred photographs.</td>', 'Originally posted by Melethia: So apparently this is not a shared cat.  The similarities between your cat and the cat who modeled for[user] cheekymunky[/user] are quite striking.  I didn''t vote the challenge, but I did peruse, and I really like this shot a lot.  Excellent composition - keeps the same storyline as the original but with a different flavor.  Your cat is very well behaved as a model!   Sometimes catnip works and sometimes it doesn''t. This was a brief interlude of tranquility of a drug crazed model and many hopelessly blurred photographs.', '2008-02-29 07:44:34.000000', NULL, 0),
