(6063733, 648622, 66597, '<td valign="top">You know, as much as I loved <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_N.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_N.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_N.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=57229" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">Raish</a>''s photo for its obvious coveting of the brown, I must admit you did yourself proud here. The duo tone is also gorgeous. That sky, the long exposure, and the reflection are fabulous.</td>', 'You know, as much as I loved  Raish''s photo for its obvious coveting of the brown, I must admit you did yourself proud here. The duo tone is also gorgeous. That sky, the long exposure, and the reflection are fabulous.', '2010-06-21 00:24:39.000000', NULL, 0),
